        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Global Education - Our World in Data</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: \"Lato\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #1d3d63;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  a { color: #1d3d63; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #a3b4c6; }\n\n  /* ---------- Top navigation ---------- */\n  .topbar {\n    background: #002147;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #c0392b;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 0 14px;\n    height: 73px;\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    padding: 0 26px 0 40px;\n    border: none;\n  }\n  .nav-links {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 26px;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .nav-links span { color: #fff; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .nav-icon { font-size: 13px; margin-right: 6px; }\n  .caret { font-size: 9px; margin-left: 4px; }\n  .nav-right {\n    margin-left: auto;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    padding-right: 30px;\n  }\n  .searchbox {\n    width: 300px;\n    height: 38px;\n    background: #143d6b;\n    border: 1px solid #3d5f8a;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 0 12px;\n    color: #b7c6d8;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .btn-outline {\n    height: 38px;\n    min-width: 112px;\n    border: 1px solid #fff;\n    color: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .btn-red {\n    height: 38px;\n    min-width: 100px;\n    background: #c0392b;\n    color: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Title band ---------- */\n  .title-band {\n    background: #ebeef2;\n    padding: 44px 0 52px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .band-inner { max-width: 1290px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 405px; }\n  h1 {\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Playfair Display\", serif;\n    font-size: 44px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n    color: #002147;\n  }\n  .byline { font-size: 15.5px; color: #4a6685; }\n\n  /* ---------- Body grid ---------- */\n  .page { max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .body-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 405px 625px 1fr;\n    padding-top: 38px;\n  }\n  .sidebar { padding-left: 30px; }\n  .contents-btn {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    border: 1px solid #c5cdd7;\n    padding: 8px 14px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #1d3d63;\n  }\n  .article p {\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Contents block ---------- */\n  .contents-wrap {\n    background: #ebeef2;\n    margin: 45px 80px 0 80px;\n    padding: 55px 0 60px;\n  }\n  .contents-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 325px 730px 1fr;\n  }\n  .contents-grid h2 {\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n    color: #002147;\n  }\n  ul.toc { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  ul.toc li {\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  ul.toc li .arrow { color: #c0392b; font-weight: bold; }\n  .work-label {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #1d3d63;\n    margin: 42px 0 12px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    background: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 16px 18px;\n    width: 292px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .card-icon {\n    width: 38px; height: 38px;\n    background: #ebeef2;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    margin-right: 16px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .card-title {\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    color: #002147;\n  }\n  .card-sub { font-size: 14px; color: #4a6685; }\n  .card-arrow { margin-left: auto; font-size: 17px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Divider ---------- */\n  hr.section-rule {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid #dfe4ea;\n    margin: 48px 80px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Section heading band ---------- */\n  .section-band {\n    background: #ebeef2;\n    margin: 0 80px;\n    padding: 42px 0 44px;\n  }\n  .section-band h2 {\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    font-size: 33px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #002147;\n    max-width: 640px;\n    padding-left: 325px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Floating buttons ---------- */\n  .float-btns {\n    position: fixed;\n    right: 20px;\n    bottom: 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .float-btn {\n    background: #002147;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"logo\">Our World<br>in Data</div>\n  <div class=\"nav-links\">\n    <span><span class=\"nav-icon\">&#9776;</span>Browse by topic</span>\n    <span>Data</span>\n    <span>Insights</span>\n    <span>Resources<span class=\"caret\">&#9660;</span></span>\n    <span>About<span class=\"caret\">&#9660;</span></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"nav-right\">\n    <div class=\"searchbox\"><span>Search for a topic, chart or article...</span><span>&#9906;</span></div>\n    <div class=\"btn-outline\">Subscribe</div>\n    <div class=\"btn-red\">Donate</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"title-band\">\n  <div class=\"band-inner\">\n    <h1>Global Education</h1>\n    <div class=\"byline\">By <a href=\"#\">Hannah Ritchie</a>, <a href=\"#\">Veronika Samborska</a>, <a href=\"#\">Esteban Ortiz-Ospina</a>, and <a href=\"#\">Max Roser</a></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"body-grid\">\n    <div class=\"sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"contents-btn\"><span>&#9776;</span> Contents</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"article\">\n      <p>A good education offers individuals the opportunity to lead richer, more interesting lives. At a societal level, it <a href=\"#\">creates opportunities</a> for humanity to solve its pressing problems.</p>\n\n      <p>The world has gone through a dramatic transition over the last few centuries, from one where very few had any basic education to one where most people do. This is not only reflected in the <em>inputs</em> to education — enrollment and attendance — but also in outcomes, where <a href=\"#\">literacy</a> rates have greatly improved.</p>\n\n      <p>Getting children into school is also not enough: <em>what</em> they learn matters. There are large <a href=\"#\">differences</a> in educational outcomes: in low-income countries, most children cannot read by the end of primary school. These inequalities in education exacerbate <a href=\"#\">poverty</a> and existing inequalities in <a href=\"#\">global incomes</a>.</p>\n\n      <p>On this page, you can find all of our writing and data on global education.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"contents-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"contents-grid\">\n      <div></div>\n      <div>\n        <h2>Contents</h2>\n        <ul class=\"toc\">\n          <li><span class=\"arrow\">&#8595;</span><span>The world has made substantial progress in increasing basic levels of education</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"arrow\">&#8595;</span><span>Despite being in school, many children don't learn basic literacy skills</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"arrow\">&#8595;</span><span>Children across the world receive very different amounts of quality learning</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"arrow\">&#8595;</span><span>Hundreds of millions of children worldwide do not go to school</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"arrow\">&#8595;</span><span>The gender gap in school attendance has closed across most of the world</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"arrow\">&#8595;</span><span>Explore the data</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"arrow\">&#8595;</span><span>Data insights</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"work-label\">All our work on global education</div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-icon\">&#128202;</div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"card-title\">Data</div>\n            <div class=\"card-sub\">See all charts</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-arrow\">&#8594;</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-icon\">&#128441;</div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"card-title\">Writing</div>\n            <div class=\"card-sub\">See all articles and insights</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-arrow\">&#8594;</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"section-rule\">\n\n  <div class=\"section-band\">\n    <h2>The world has made substantial progress<br>in increasing basic levels of education</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"body-grid\">\n    <div></div>\n    <div class=\"article\">\n      <p>Access to education is now seen as a fundamental right. In many cases, it's the government's duty to provide it.</p>\n\n      <p>But formal education is a very recent phenomenon. In the chart, we see the share of the adult population — those older than 15 — who has received some basic education and those who haven't.</p>\n\n      <p>In the early 1800s, fewer than 1 in 5 adults had some basic education. Education was a luxury; in all places, it was only available to a small elite.</p>\n\n      <p>But you can see that this share has grown dramatically, such that this ratio is now reversed. Less than 1 in 5 adults has not received any formal education.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div></div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"float-btns\">\n  <div class=\"float-btn\"><span>&#9993;</span> Subscribe</div>\n  <div class=\"float-btn\"><span>&#128172;</span> Feedback</div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
